@startuml
title Auralis - Audio Data Pipeline

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

component "System Audio" as Source
component "PipeWire Capture" as Capture
component "Audio Capture Engine" as ACE
component "Processing / Normalization" as Process
component "Master Source Timeline" as Timeline
component "Multi-Output Router" as Router

component "Ring Buffer A" as BA
component "Ring Buffer B" as BB
component "Ring Buffer C" as BC

component "Sync/Delay A" as SA
component "Sync/Delay B" as SB
component "Sync/Delay C" as SC

component "PipeWire Output A" as OA
component "PipeWire Output B" as OB
component "PipeWire Output C" as OC

node "Hearing Device A" as HA
node "Hearing Device B" as HB
node "Hearing Device C" as HC

Source --> Capture
Capture --> ACE : PCM
ACE --> Process
Process --> Timeline
Timeline --> Router

Router --> BA
Router --> BB
Router --> BC

BA --> SA
BB --> SB
BC --> SC

SA --> OA
SB --> OB
SC --> OC

OA --> HA : Host Bluetooth audio path
OB --> HB : Host Bluetooth audio path
OC --> HC : Host Bluetooth audio path

note right of Router
One failing output must not
block the other output queues.
end note

note bottom of Timeline
All outputs consume the same
logical source sequence/timeline.
end note
@enduml
